// atos-comp's command for its `System(Launcher)` shortcut (#64): opens or closes the launcher
// of the running shell. The image installs this file as
// /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Shortcuts/v1/system_actions; the keys bound to
// the action are in components/c2-compositor/data/keybindings.ron (Super, Super+/).
{
    Launcher: "atos-shell --launcher",
}
